  "name": "servo",
  "description": "Servo is a high-performance, parallelized web browser engine designed to leverage the memory safety and concurrency primitives of the Rust language. Its architecture decomposes the traditional monolithic browser pipeline into independent, task-oriented components for layout, scripting (SpiderMonkey), networking, and compositing, enabling fine-grained parallelism across CPU cores and GPU-accelerated rendering via display lists.",
